time_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 16210, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HqFGZtsEA9eLDGATW28qtx", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17016, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RYRm4c3vv1vWFtu6nc8uyQ", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17316, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RYRm4c3vv1vWFtu6nc8uyQ", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17316, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RYRm4c3vv1vWFtu6nc8uyQ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 21120, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01GJwcaq7izNib8UZ8B7vWPt", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: (1) Identified v2.3.0 as the most recent production release that was healthy (v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy in production; v2.3.1-rc is unhealthy in staging). (2) Ran rollback to v2.3.0 across all production regions. The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error (partial failure, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and us-west/eu-west on v2.3.1). (3) Retried the rollback to v2.3.0; it completed in us-east, us-west, and eu-west. Current state: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error_rate 0.002 (was 0.18). No deployment of a never-healthy version was performed. Follow-ups: investigate root cause of v2.3.1 health-check failures and the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback attempt; confirm v2.3.1 remains blocked from redeploy until fixed.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2026-incident-1"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 51720, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GJwcaq7izNib8UZ8B7vWPt", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2026-incident-1", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 51720, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GJwcaq7izNib8UZ8B7vWPt", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 53045, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01URLHHQQa51rdtFockvF2QG", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 53345, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01URLHHQQa51rdtFockvF2QG", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53345, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01URLHHQQa51rdtFockvF2QG", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 55738, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions and is healthy again (error rate 0.18 \u2192 0.002). The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release marked healthy. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, so I did not deploy anything that lacked a healthy production record and no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback once and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found INC-0001 already recorded with the full summary, so I did not create a duplicate page.\n\nFollow-ups for the on-call team: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 health-check failures, and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback attempt. v2.3.1 should stay blocked from redeploy until it is fixed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Ki7BePYsn8KPBBHuiKXCwU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01VxdCif1cQcH1MzrrmDL3fH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is the unhealthy one in production. Rolling back to v2.3.0, which has a healthy production record, so it doesn't need change-manager approval.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01MBSKxHacD1YNW6d6zo8QHa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0132yYiXt8wYZ7ApEUwkK1aj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0